	(text_box "The LDO is a voltage converter that give a clean and stable voltage, with little ripples. As it needs a stable enough input we put it after the buck-boost. The capacitors and resistors were chosen according to the LDO's datasheet, and we have chosen to add a trimmer to be able to adjust the voltage ouput after manufacturing. We use a XT30 connector to supply the power to the processing board.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 116.5606 0)
		(size 52.07 20.5994)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
